      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "a. Adopting with the approval of the Deputy Mayor for Operations, a New York City Information Technology Strategy (the \"Technology Strategy\") detailing the overall direction for the City regarding the use of technology and related infrastructures. The Technology Strategy shall be issued by March 1, 1999, and shall be reviewed annually thereafter and supplemented as appropriate;",
